00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:16.875
I guess I was right.

00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:19.625
Xiao Yu likes Li Mo!

00:01:20.041 --> 00:01:22.125
Xiao Yu likes Li Mo!

00:01:22.458 --> 00:01:24.125
Xiao Yu likes Li Mo!

00:01:24.208 --> 00:01:27.625
I'm going to beat you up. Seriously.

00:01:27.708 --> 00:01:28.791
The tape!

00:01:32.416 --> 00:01:36.708
-This is beyond fixing.
-It's punishment from above.

00:01:37.541 --> 00:01:40.833
-What'd you say?
-Calm down. Let's listen to mine.

